-------------+---------------------------------------------------------------
          m1 |      4,970  -3444.941  -1701.944       3   3409.888   3429.422
          m2 |      4,970  -3444.941  -1670.968       4   3349.937   3375.981
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note: BIC uses N = number of observations. See [R] IC note.

. lrtest m2 m1

Likelihood-ratio test
Assumption: m1 nested within m2

 LR chi2(1) =  61.95
Prob > chi2 = 0.0000

